---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: es
transKey: plan-catalog
pageCss:
  - planes-hub.css
  - plan-page.css
title: "Planes de Entrenamiento — filtra por deporte y nivel"
description: "Todos los planes de entrenamiento de Triaperformance en TrainingPeaks: running, ciclismo, natación, triatlón, duatlón y HYROX. Filtra por deporte, distancia, nivel y duración."
---
{%- set catalogPlans = plans.byLanguage.es -%}
{%- set u = planUi.es -%}
<section class="plan-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label">Planes de Entrenamiento</span>
    <h1>Elige tu objetivo, y el plan</h1>
    {#- The old sentence listed HYROX beside five sports, which is the same
        category error the tile row below it was just fixed for: HYROX is a
        distance and every HYROX plan is sport=Running. Sports only. -#}
    <p class="section-intro">{{ catalogPlans.length }} planes en TrainingPeaks — running, ciclismo, natación, triatlón, duatlón y fuerza. Elige un deporte, o filtra por distancia, nivel y duración.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    {#- 🚨 SPORTS ONLY, and the counts now sum to the catalogue.
        Measured September 9, 2026: the six-tile version listed HYROX and
        Ironman as siblings of Running and Triatlón, and both are DISTANCES —
        all 7 HYROX plans are sport=Running and all 13 Half/Full plans are
        sport=Triathlon. So 20 plans were counted twice and the chooser summed
        to 172 against a 164-plan catalogue, while Duatlón (10) and Fuerza (2)
        had no entry point at all. Four sports = 152, plus those 12 = 164.
        Do not re-add a distance to this row. -#}
    <nav class="sport-tiles" aria-label="{{ u.filterSport }}">
      <a class="sport-tile" href="/planes/running/"><b>{{ u.sport["Running"] or "Running" }}</b><span>{{ catalogPlans | facetCount("sport", "Running") }} {{ u.resultsCount }}</span></a>
      <a class="sport-tile" href="/planes/ciclismo/"><b>{{ u.sport["Cycling"] or "Cycling" }}</b><span>{{ catalogPlans | facetCount("sport", "Cycling") }} {{ u.resultsCount }}</span></a>
      <a class="sport-tile" href="/planes/triatlon/"><b>{{ u.sport["Triathlon"] or "Triathlon" }}</b><span>{{ catalogPlans | facetCount("sport", "Triathlon") }} {{ u.resultsCount }}</span></a>
      <a class="sport-tile" href="/planes/natacion/"><b>{{ u.sport["Swimming"] or "Swimming" }}</b><span>{{ catalogPlans | facetCount("sport", "Swimming") }} {{ u.resultsCount }}</span></a>
    </nav>
    <p class="sport-goals">
      <span class="label">O por objetivo</span>
      <a href="/planes/hyrox/">HYROX <span>{{ catalogPlans | facetCount("distance", "HYROX") }}</span></a>
      <a href="/planes/ironman/">Ironman 70.3 y 140.6 <span>{{ (catalogPlans | facetCount("distance", "Half")) + (catalogPlans | facetCount("distance", "Full")) }}</span></a>
    </p>
    {#- Duatlón and Fuerza have no hub page of their own, which is why Phase 1's
        criterion 4 was only half met. Named here rather than given a tile,
        because a tile that lands on an unfiltered 164-plan grid is a worse
        answer than a sentence. Two hubs would close it properly. -#}
    <p class="sport-rest">También hay {{ catalogPlans | facetCount("sport", "Duathlon") }} planes de duatlón y {{ catalogPlans | facetCount("sport", "Strength") }} de fuerza, <a href="#catalogo">en el catálogo completo</a>.</p>
    <div class="planes-aa">
      <p>Si vas a preparar más de un objetivo este año, no compres de a uno. Todo el catálogo por <b>${{ allAccess.es.price }}/mes</b>.</p>
      <a href="/all-access/">Conoce All-Access</a>
    </div>
    <div class="catalog-recommended-head">
      <h2>{{ u.recommendedLabel }}</h2>
      <p>{{ u.recommendedIntro }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    {#- `id="catalogo"` is what the "catálogo completo" line above points at.
        Every sport hub already had one; /planes/ did not, and the anchor test
        caught it the moment something linked to it. -#}
    <div id="catalogo"></div>
    {% include "partials/plan-catalog-grid.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/coaching-cta.njk" %}
